        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Must have a minimum of one (1) year of experience in a clinical or research molecular (DNA) laboratory, not including time on training nor time as a trainee, performing clinical molecular (DNA) diagnostic testing procedures and techniques. Must have the demonstrated ability to perform clinical molecular (DNA) diagnostic testing procedures and techniques as determined by the Employer, including preparing human and bacterial samples using genomic and plasmid DNA preparation techniques, performing restriction enzyme digestion techniques, and performing electrophoresis blotting, hybridization and sequencing techniques on DNA samples.",
